-2uHUEMgtZQlUxe7kBA-WRg9KyMvPRFcYHjhw&oe=69EF62F6"}, {"file_name": "AssaultOnBase.png", "id": "443113451591277", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982544_443113454924610_3676545296571915906_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=67kqiNv6PKwQ7kNvwE1mkd7&_nc_oc=Ado53Hf1CKKQ9kCoD_nD9weemvKKqFxJp6ozKIwHTASWCxLJ_Bon7-rMcPi7a03O2JY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2iEp5RbpBmhB5mSg6L95bvXAdrCdRuYN_wWo11bYkMHA&oe=69EF5F46"}, {"file_name": "Labyrinth.png", "id": "1300393411339063", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982674_1300393414672396_5204739748604220557_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JPM3Tti3TbQQ7kNvwED8ORi&_nc_oc=AdrGenpUJEOwKlTvjf3j6x0_2SEkYn3N47rB3XStODR7H8AoiuSC4MzEqY-dB8nP8HA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0f3sIcqWW2RL93nkLMcB-TNLEj9JHztAZ1HaQJelKznQ&oe=69EF6D08"}, {"file_name": "Turret.png", "id": "2302745436726053", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974751_2302745440059386_4335230081335400553_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gm4VjIIZ0sUQ7kNvwH4FrPq&_nc_oc=AdpSXpwRRKH80u0r8dWj4TfPwrbHGEyjgm8M--DNObYLOaDy8AwJkx6MEoEpOkk9n_8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2dSuMwlTv_DPE_uGGSBMv8bz2PrMh1iG3daJcGjmP9_g&oe=69EF5ADF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "1083730483394050", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86615253_1083730486727383_4084447030365624247_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LhToKeqcsI0Q7kNvwESZBkM&_nc_oc=AdqWNVonjfIV5KeMH27LirfTKbBCGFzQHfSCIXX8nrPc6IDx4uN1Y62F0gF5gITGp5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0H66RaRL3Oq4hX0XWloGzfaIsfKS6ZbE33xbPzFfMgow&oe=69EF73AB"}, "display_name": "Catastrophic Inversion", "keywords": ["Arena", "Laser", "Cyber", "Huge", "Neon"], "long_description": "Catastrophic Inversion is a VR laser-tag experience built for large spaces, like the gym at your school or community center.\nInstead of using a joystick or teleporting, you **walk naturally around the maps**, alongside the other players.\nWith two simple taps to calibrate, everyone is lined up and ready to go.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE:** in order to play in shared space on maps larger than 33' x 33'. you will need to have your headset in **Developer Mode** so you can temporarily disable the Guardian boundary.\nThis can be done in the **Headset Settings** on the **Meta Horizon** mobile app. You will need to create a meta developer account, but anyone can do this even if they aren't a developer.\n\n**Take on your friends** in several exciting locations in a **neon cyber world!**\n\n- One-time setup of a space takes only a few minutes.\n- If you don't have a large space, you can play in joystick mode.\n- Multiplayer is hosted locally and can be done without an internet connection. (LAN Wi-Fi connection still required.)\n\nCatastrophic Inversion is still in early access. There are some quality-of-life updates and much more content on the way, but currently the game offers:\n- Four Weapon Types (Including Powered Turrets)\n- Customizable Game Modes (CTF/Deathmatch/Elimination, timed/scored, teams/free-for-all)\n- Two 89' x 50' maps\n- One 79' x 46' map\n- One 33' x 33' map\n- One 10' x 10' demo platform for testing the Shared Space features at home.", "short_description": "Grab your friends, bring your headsets, and head to the biggest space you can find!\n\nCatastrophic Inversion is a cyber-themed shooter that allows you to turn any large space into an immersive multiplayer VR experience rivaling professional venues."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/policies", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/policies", "publisher_name": "Toastid Waffel", "support_website_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/about-us", "